# Build context of infra/caddy/Dockerfile (repository root). The API image has its own context (apps/api) and its
# own apps/api/.dockerignore. The Dockerfile copies only what the web build and Caddy need; this file keeps the
# context small and keeps secrets and local artefacts out of it.

# Secrets and local data
.env
.env.*
backups
data
certs

# Dependencies, build output and caches (npm ci and the build run inside the image)
**/node_modules
dist
.angular
out-tsc
tmp
coverage
**/bin
**/obj
**/.sass-cache

# Not part of the web build
.git
apps/api
tests
test-results
playwright-report
**/TestResults
plan
prototype
docs
tools
.vscode
.vs
.idea
.history
*.log
